WEBVTT

NOTE
Pandemona - Tornado Zone. Wind elemental summon.
Observed duration in reference video: ~24 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Pandemona. Tornado Zone.

00:02.500 --> 00:08.000
Wind whips across the battlefield. The clouds tear sideways.

00:08.000 --> 00:14.000
A tall, draped figure with wild flowing hair and a long cape descends on rushing winds.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
